# D4 realtime paper-shadow validation — RPC config (read-only).
# Copy to .env.d4 (gitignored) and fill in your endpoint. NO wallet keys here.
#
# Use a dedicated Alchemy Base-mainnet endpoint for this project so usage is
# isolated and rate-capped. The runner only makes read calls
# (eth_blockNumber, eth_getLogs, eth_gasPrice, eth_call).
D4_BASE_RPC_URL=https://base-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_ALCHEMY_KEY_HERE
